Hosts reach Prasravaṇa hill and bow to Rāma Lakṣmaṇa Sugrīva --- Monkeys report Rāvaṇa prison Rākṣasī threats Sītā faith and deadline --- Rāma asks where Sītā is and how she fares toward him --- Monkeys urge expert Hanumān to tell Sītā tidings --- Hanumān tells leaping hundred-yōjana sea seeking Jānakī --- Hanumān finds Sītā in Rāvaṇa palace living on hope in Rāma --- Hanumān sees her threatened in pleasure grove single-braided pale ground-sleeping --- Hanumān tells Ikṣvāku fame Sugrīva pact and wins her trust --- Sītā gives Chūḍāmaṇi crow token tilaka mark and one-month deadline --- Hanumān urges bridging the sea to rescue her
